Because voidwalkers are the only pet that can reliably keep enemies off the warlock while leveling solo. Their taunts, self-sacrifice shield, and out‑of‑combat heal let you pull safely, chain pulls, and survive mistakes. Succubus offers better damage and CC, but without a taunt she can’t protect you from adds or chain‑pulls, making her riskier for solo leveling. [end of text]


